  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preservation of the Ismamyt-Ata Monument, Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A few brick and plaster structures at Ismamyt-Ata are all that remain of a once-thriving medieval town, now an important sacred site for Turkmen, Uzbeks, and Kazakhs. This third and final project completes work begun under previous Ambassadors Fund grants to conserve all the structures within the monument.</narrative>
  </description>
